From 6de25620b19f2b8413f37dd44d85c25663e2825f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iced-Cream <86374804+Iced-Cream@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:50:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] core-ar2 0.20: ev_store_adopt, a sound's or kit's
 pre-core data handed to its mod once

st_sound_load and st_kit_load zero the fields of a sound or kit whose stored
layout ID or generation the build does not read. Before anything reads
them, core now calls each ev_store_adopt handler with the scope, the live
item, the stored item and the ID it carries, so a mod can set its fields
from its own older bytes. core_store_set skips the write-through for the
item being adopted; the item takes the build's ID at its next save.
Storage fields only: lock rows and scene entries of another layout are
dropped as before. examples/adopt-check-ar2 is the probe.
